            "text": "{\"video\":{\"url\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0ab3e848/8qwTMkjY3rPzvs0UT29NB_minimax-h3.mp4\",\"content_type\":\"video/mp4\",\"file_name\":\"8qwTMkjY3rPzvs0UT29NB_minimax-h3.mp4\",\"file_size\":7496290},\"expanded_prompt\":\"subject_definitions:\\n<Subject 1> is the man from <Picture 1>, featuring short tousled light-brown hair, wearing an olive-green crew-neck T-shirt, black shorts, and black flip-flops.\\n\\nsummary:\\n[reference generation] The target video shows <Subject 1> walking on a rainy city sidewalk and performing a prat fall, maintaining his appearance and outfit from <Picture 1>.\\n\\nretention_analysis:\\n<Subject 1> (appears in [Shot 1]): fully_preserved - his facial features, hair style, and clothing are identical to the reference character sheet.\\n\\ndetailed_description:\\nThe video is a real-life vertical smartphone video, filmed handheld with slight natural shake to mimic an ordinary phone-camera look. The setting is a Bangkok sidewalk during a light afternoon rain, with natural daylight illuminating the realistic textures of skin and damp fabric. \\n[Shot 1] <Subject 1> strolls toward the camera on the wet pavement. He holds an open red umbrella high in one hand, wearing a pleased, self-satisfied expression. The ground is dark with moisture, showing visible painted curb lines. As he walks, his right flip-flop skids on the wet painted curb line. He loses balance instantly and performs a classic silent-film prat fall: both feet fly up into the air before he lands flat on his back on the wet pavement. The red umbrella pops out of his hand, bounces once on the hard ground, and lands upside down beside him, where it immediately begins to fill with falling rainwater. <Subject 1> lies still for a beat, recovering, then he slowly lifts his head and looks directly into the camera lens with a deadpan, stoic expression, appearing completely unhurt. The entire sequence is one continuous shot with no cuts.\\n\\noverall_soundscape:\\nThe sound of light rain hitting the pavement and the umbrella canopy, the slap of flip-flops on wet concrete, and the dull thud of a body hitting the ground. \\n\\nnon_diegetic_music:\\nN/A\",\"seed\":1619763497,\"reference_tokens\":1472,\"timings\":{\"inference\":3.039661001000013}}"
